      en: ["Largest city in the Mekong Delta of Vietnam", "Can Tho Bridge is the longest cable-stayed bridge in SE Asia", "Home to the Cai Rang market, active since the early 20th century", "Economic hub for rice and fruit exports", "Features an international airport (VCA)", "Seat of the leading university for agricultural research (1966)"],
